<div class="phead "><div class="wrap"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol class="crumbs"><li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/">Home</a></li><li aria-current="page">Services</li></ol></nav><h1>What I do</h1><p>New homes, ADUs, remodels and honest first advice — all by the same one architect.</p></div></div>
<div class="body"><div class="wrap">
<div class="svcs">{% for s in Target.Items %}{%- assign x = s.PublishedContent -%}<a class="svc" href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ s.RoutePath }}"><span class="n">0{{ forloop.index }}</span><h3>{{ s.PrimaryField }}</h3><p>{{ x.tagline }}. {{ x.timeline }}.</p><i class="bi bi-arrow-up-right go" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>{% endfor %}</div>
<div class="grid g3" style="margin-top:56px">
<div class="card pad"><i class="bi bi-git" style="font-size:1.6rem;color:var(--acc)" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3 style="margin:12px 0 6px">You know who drew it</h3><p class="muted" style="margin:0">Every drawing and decision is in your portal, made by the architect you hired.</p></div>
<div class="card pad"><i class="bi bi-hdd-network" style="font-size:1.6rem;color:var(--acc)" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3 style="margin:12px 0 6px">One phone number</h3><p class="muted" style="margin:0">Questions go to Elena — at the permit counter, on site, and after move-in.</p></div>
<div class="card pad"><i class="bi bi-people" style="font-size:1.6rem;color:var(--acc)" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3 style="margin:12px 0 6px">Few projects, on purpose</h3><p class="muted" style="margin:0">Four to six projects a year, so yours gets my mornings, not my leftovers.</p></div>
</div></div></div>
